    "executed_locally": true,
    "notes_en": "Microtasks 177 syna_open and 178 syna_release were executed locally in a clean worktree. For each target, stock Ghidra/P-Code, assembly, KCFI, strict Joern, and an ASan/UBSan harness that includes the production source were verified. The complete module was built twice with identical SHA-256 values and its KMI parity was checked. No smartphone, loadable module, or hardware was used. The complete driver remains incomplete.",
    "notes_pt": "As microtarefas 177 syna_open e 178 syna_release foram executadas localmente em uma worktree limpa. Para cada alvo, Ghidra/P-Code stock, Assembly, KCFI, Joern estrito e um harness ASAN/UBSAN que inclui a fonte de producao foram verificados. O modulo completo foi compilado duas vezes com SHA-256 identico e sua paridade KMI foi conferida. Nenhum smartphone, modulo carregavel ou hardware foi usado. O driver completo permanece incompleto.",
    "reviewer_rerun_required": true
  },
